gametitle=Ace Combat 5: The Unsung War [SLUS-20851] (NTSC-U)

// Target: 5120x1440; exact ratio 32:9.
// Folder 32;9 is a display-class label; the actual pixel ratio controls these values.
// Author: danyole7. Derived from the existing 12:5 patch for this game.
// Generated variant: math/code checked offline; in-game validation pending.
// Install only ONE ratio variant. Use Fit to Fullscreen/Stretch and a matching game area.
// Cold boot after changing patches; use an in-game save, not an old emulator savestate.
// nemesis2000's corrected 16:9 projection was the baseline. To preserve object
// Gameplay focal values and virtual height scale together from the tested 2.4:1 calibration.
// Scripted cutscene lens numerator and height use (16/9)/target ratio.
// Subtitle X offsets and applicable clip bounds use signed integer scale 1/2, preserving their centers.

[Ultrawide - 5120x1440 (32:9)]
author=danyole7
description=Experimental 5120x1440 variant. Use Stretch/Fit to Fullscreen; fully restart. Preserves the source patch feature scope; see README.md.

